# ttr: dialect=b lang=en
Load stock as sk.
Load orders as o.
Keep the rows where (aa is less than bb or cc is empty) and (dd = ee or ff is empty).
Keep the rows where aa is less than bb or cc is empty and dd = ee.
Keep the rows where (amount + fee) * 2 is more than 100.
Compute prio as 1 when (amount is more than 5000 and note is not empty) or state = "urgent", otherwise 2.
Join that with sk on kk = sk.kk2 and (aa is less than sk.bb or cc is more than sk.dd) as y.
If (prio = 1 or amount is more than 10000) and state = "open":
    Show the result as urgent.
